{"book":"jeremiah","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T11:51:40.902348783Z","verse":27,"ref":"jeremiah 17:27","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":17,"translation":"And if you do not listen to me, to consecrate ⟨את⟩ the day of the sabbath, and to refrain from bearing a burden, and from coming in through the gates of Jerusalem on the day of the sabbath, then I will kindle a fire in its gates, and it will devour the citadels of Jerusalem, and it will not be extinguished.”","tokens":[{"surface":"ואם","gloss":"And if"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"תשמעו","gloss":"you will hearken"},{"surface":"אלי","gloss":"to me"},{"surface":"לקדש","gloss":"to consecrate"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the day of the sabbath"},{"surface":"יום","gloss":"the day"},{"surface":"השבת","gloss":"of the sabbath"},{"surface":"ולבלתי","gloss":"and not"},{"surface":"שאת","gloss":"to bear"},{"surface":"משא","gloss":"a burden"},{"surface":"ובא","gloss":"and coming"},{"surface":"בשערי","gloss":"in through the gates"},{"surface":"ירושלם","gloss":"of Jerusalem"},{"surface":"ביום","gloss":"on the day"},{"surface":"השבת","gloss":"of the sabbath"},{"surface":"והצתי","gloss":"then I will kindle"},{"surface":"אש","gloss":"a fire"},{"surface":"בשעריה","gloss":"in its gates"},{"surface":"ואכלה","gloss":"and it will devour"},{"surface":"ארמנות","gloss":"the citadels"},{"surface":"ירושלם","gloss":"of Jerusalem"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and not"},{"surface":"תכבה","gloss":"it will be extinguished"}]}